OL,3,GNEWSAKevin Keegan awarded Newcastle's
OL,4,Ahighest honour
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootball legend Kevin Keegan is to be
OL,7,Fawarded Newcastle's highest honour.
OL,9,FThe former Newcastle United player and
OL,10,Fmanager will be put forward for the
OL,11,FFreedom of the City next week,
OL,12,Ffollowing his death earlier this year
OL,13,Faged 75.
OL,15,FKeegan will become the first person to
OL,16,Fbe posthumously awarded the title,
OL,17,Fwhich Newcastle City Council said would
OL,18,F"serve as a lasting tribute to a man
OL,19,Fwho meant so much to the city".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
