OL,3,GNEWSAKevin Keegan awarded Newcastle's
OL,4,Ahighest honour
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe local authority confirmed he was
OL,7,Fdue to be awarded earlier this year,
OL,8,Fbut it was not formally agreed before
OL,9,Fhe died in July, weeks after he
OL,10,Frevealed his cancer diagnosis.
